## 272. 有限占据 pole–zero 对

```lean
theorem bounded_occupancy_euler_factor
    (E : ℝ) (m : ℕ) :
    ∏' p : Nat.Primes,
      ∑ j ∈ Finset.range m,
        (p : ℂ) ^ (-(j : ℂ) * E * s) =
      riemannZeta (E * s) /
        riemannZeta ((m : ℝ) * E * s)
```

